 * Comprehensive JUnit‑4 test suite for {@code org.apache.commons.lang.time.StopWatch}.
 *
 * The tests cover:
 *   • All public API methods (constructor, start, stop, reset, split, unsplit,
 *     suspend, resume, getTime, getSplitTime, toString, toSplitString).
 *   • Normal usage scenarios.
 *   • Edge‑cases and illegal‑state transitions that must raise
 *     {@link IllegalStateException}.
 *   • Basic verification of the string representation format.
 *
 * The suite deliberately uses short {@code Thread.sleep} pauses (5‑20 ms)
